  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The orbital in which last electron is present is called the highest occupied molecular orbital(HOMO).</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></msup><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mi>HOMO</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></msup><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"n